title 5G Network Slicing – NSSAI Selection

participant UE
participant gNB
participant AMF
participant NSSF
participant SMF

UE -> gNB: Registration Request (NSSAI)
gNB -> AMF: Initial UE Message

AMF -> NSSF: Slice Selection Request
NSSF -> AMF: Slice Selection Response

AMF -> SMF: SMF Selection Request
SMF -> AMF: SMF Selection Response

UE -> AMF: PDU Session Establishment Request

@enduml
